ot list the city's laws for the current term, so the mayor's profile does not show how many laws were signed.","This City Council's SAPL system records no veto since January 1, 2025. Since there is no way to tell whether there was no veto or it was not recorded, the mayor's profile does not show the number of vetoes."],"conferido":"2026-10-27"}},"atualizado":"2026-10-15","onde":{"camara":{"site":"https://www.jarinu.sp.leg.br/","sistema":"sapl","api":"https://sapl.jarinu.sp.leg.br/api/","propostas":"https://sapl.jarinu.sp.leg.br/materia/pesquisar-materia","propostasOnline":true,"sic":"https://www.jarinu.sp.leg.br/ouvidoria","conferido":"2026-10-27","motivo":null,"motivo_en":null},"prefeitura":{"site":"https://www.jarinu.sp.gov.br/","transparencia":"https://webapp1-jarinu.cidade360.cloud/pronimtb/","sic":"https://jarinu.sp.gov.br/ouvidoria","diarioOficial":{"nome":"Diário Oficial do Município de Jarinu","url":"https://jarinu.sp.gov.br/diariooficial","plataforma":"Própria (site oficial)"},"conferido":"2026-10-26"}}}
